      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I've encountered this issue and found a repro step so I'll explain it to you; there's a property named `acknowledgements` in the JSON data of recently uploaded or updated avatars, and it seems to cause the issue.\n\nI compared and tested an avatar uploaded a few months ago with one uploaded yesterday, the olde avatar doesn't have this property and can save changes without any problems, but recent avatars contain this property, which seems to prevent them from saving changes.",
